  "description": "Aspose.Imaging.Pdf.Adapter Combines 2 Aspose products Aspose.Imaging and Aspose.Pdf, this allows  to use the functions of both libraries as a single whole and expand conversion between formats. Formats emf, wmf, cdr, psd, tiff, webp etc. can now be converted to formats such as pdf (with more advanced settings), docx, xlsx, html.\nPDF format can be converted to all formats supported by Imaging, for example Emf, Wmf, J2k, Webp etc.",
